# M1: (a0+a1 t+a2 t^2) A^2/(1+d A) + (b0+b1 t+b2 t^2) A/(1+d A) ... simpler: rational with t-poly numerators
def M1(p):
    d=p[0]
    num=(p[1]+p[2]*t+p[3]*t**2)*A**2+(p[4]+p[5]*t+p[6]*t**2)*A+(p[7]+p[8]*t+p[9]*t**2)*A**3
    return num/(1+d*A)
run('M1',M1,[rng.normal(size=10) for _ in range(20)])
# M2: exp decay in t: (a0 A^n) with k(t)=exp(-k t)
